        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Day 1337: All sense of time and being are entombed within darkness. How long has passed since I came here? My senses are a blur. My past life, my prior goals, my very self is all but a distant memory. All I know now is the constant squealing of rats and the ever growing mountain of flesh that feasts before me."),
          },
        ],
      },
