        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_46",
        on: "water_dialogue",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("You have done well so far to master the reanimation of skeletons. Now, I shall teach you to control spirits. Are you ready?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_47",
        on: "cutscene2",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("Mastery over ghosts, especially the more powerful ones, is something even experienced necromancers may struggle with. While other undead are nothing more than mindless slaves upon reanimation, spirits are the souls of their original owners and thus retain some degree of consciousness. If the spirit is stronger than you, it will break free of your hold. To master it, your own soul must be unwavering."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("I doubt I shall be overcome by the soul of an orc."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("Perhaps, but that is not what I meant. Before you can begin to control other souls, you must first master your own."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("What do you mean? I am proud. I am strong. If it is a matter of conviction—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("It is not I that you must convince, but yourself. Hold thy tongue and listen. After a great slaughter, even after the corpses are all rotted to nothing but bones, the bridge between the land of death and life is weakened. By placing yourself closer to death, you will better understand who it is that you really are. But you must not speak. Be silent and embrace the darkness."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("Concentrate."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Wwg",
            cells: "4,10;4,11;5,11",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "wail-sml.wav",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 750,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "wail.wav",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1250,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "wail-long.wav",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "units",
            kill: "yes",
            not_id: "Malin Keshar",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
