          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Fake Malin",
            text: _("When you do not have the wisdom to see through the veil of lies you have told yourself, you must not seek the advice of one who only spins the web of deception further."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Enough with this. No proverbs are going to help me achieve my goals. This is just like back on Alduin. My teachers never understood what I needed. I don’t need to think and I don’t need to philosophize about “the grand nature of my life and my place in the universe.” Right now, I must train my skills with necromancy. That’s it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Fake Malin",
            text: _("When you are sad and alone, even all the power in the world will not help you. In the barren void of endless night, will rage and hatred alone be enough to sustain you?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("... well, my choice is already made. Rethinking it now is pointless. I have never been one for regrets."),
          },
