            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("... Damn it all. As if I would pay any heed to a twisted doppelganger of myself. Anyway..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("What did Darken Volk say about it again? “After a great slaughter, even after the corpses are all rotted to nothing but bones, the bridge between the land of death and life is weakened.” If I use that knowledge..."),
